
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    >

    <title>Terms & Conditions | Vibely</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family:
                -apple-system,
                BlinkMacSystemFont,
                "Segoe UI",
                Roboto,
                Helvetica,
                Arial,
                sans-serif;

            background: #f7f7f7;
            color: #222;
        }

        .terms-page {
            width: min(1000px, 92%);
            margin: 60px auto 100px;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 60px 70px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow:
                0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        .terms-header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            padding-bottom: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .terms-header h1 {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 3rem;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.04em;
            color: #111;
        }

        .terms-header p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .terms-date {
            font-size: 0.9rem !important;
            color: #888 !important;
        }

        .terms-section {
            margin-bottom: 38px;
        }

        .terms-section h2 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: #111;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .terms-section p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .terms-section ul {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            padding-left: 24px;
        }

        .terms-section li {
            margin-bottom: 9px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .terms-footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 25px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {

            .terms-page {
                width: 94%;
                margin: 30px auto 60px;
                padding: 40px 30px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }

            .terms-header h1 {
                font-size: 2.3rem;
            }

            .terms-section h2 {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            .terms-page {
                width: 100%;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 35px 22px 50px;
                border-radius: 0;
                box-shadow: none;
            }

            .terms-header {
                padding-bottom: 25px;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

            .terms-header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .terms-header p,
            .terms-section p,
            .terms-section li {
                font-size: 0.95rem;
            }

            .terms-section {
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

            .terms-section h2 {
                font-size: 1.15rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>


<body>

    <main class="terms-page">

        <header class="terms-header">

            <h1>
                Terms & Conditions
            </h1>

            <p>
                These Terms & Conditions govern your access to and
                use of the Vibely website and services.
            </p>

            <p class="terms-date">
                Last updated:
                <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-IN") %>
            </p>

        </header>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>

            <p>
                By accessing or using Vibely, you agree to comply
                with these Terms & Conditions and all applicable
                laws and regulations.
            </p>

            <p>
                If you do not agree with these terms, you should
                not use Vibely's services.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>2. About Vibely</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely provides an online platform through which
                users may discover, view, and interact with
                property listings.
            </p>

            <p>
                Unless expressly stated otherwise, Vibely does
                not own, manage, or control the properties listed
                by users.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>3. User Accounts</h2>

            <p>
                Certain features may require you to create an
                account. You agree to provide accurate and
                up-to-date information.
            </p>

            <p>
                You are responsible for maintaining the
                confidentiality of your account credentials and
                for activity conducted through your account.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>4. Property Listings</h2>

            <p>
                Users who submit property listings are responsible
                for the accuracy, completeness, and legality of
                the information, images, pricing, availability,
                and descriptions they provide.
            </p>

            <p>
                Vibely may remove, restrict, or modify listings
                that violate these terms, applicable law, or
                platform rules.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>5. User Conduct</h2>

            <p>
                You agree not to use Vibely to:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    Provide false, misleading, or fraudulent
                    information.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Impersonate another person or entity.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Upload unlawful, abusive, or harmful content.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Infringe intellectual property or privacy
                    rights.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Attempt unauthorized access to accounts or
                    systems.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Interfere with the operation or security of
                    the platform.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Use automated methods to scrape or collect
                    platform data without authorization.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Use the platform for unlawful purposes.
                </li>
            </ul>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>6. Bookings and Transactions</h2>

            <p>
                Where Vibely provides booking or transaction
                functionality, users are responsible for reviewing
                the relevant property, pricing, availability,
                policies, and transaction details before completing
                a transaction.
            </p>

            <p>
                Additional booking, cancellation, refund, or
                payment terms may apply to specific transactions.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>7. Payments</h2>

            <p>
                Payments may be processed through third-party
                payment providers. Payment information may be
                handled directly by those providers according to
                their applicable terms and privacy policies.
            </p>

            <p>
                Vibely does not guarantee the availability or
                uninterrupted operation of third-party payment
                services.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>8. Reviews and Ratings</h2>

            <p>
                Users may be permitted to submit reviews and
                ratings based on their experiences.
            </p>

            <p>
                Reviews must be honest, relevant, and based on
                genuine experiences. Vibely may remove content
                that is fraudulent, abusive, misleading, unlawful,
                or otherwise violates these Terms.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely's website, branding, design, software, text,
                graphics, logos, and other original materials are
                protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
            </p>

            <p>
                You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or
                commercially exploit Vibely materials without
                appropriate authorization.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>10. Third-Party Services and Links</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely may use or link to third-party services.
                Vibely is not responsible for the content,
                availability, policies, or practices of
                third-party services.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>11. Disclaimer</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely provides the platform and its content on an
                "as available" basis. We do not guarantee that the
                website will always be uninterrupted, error-free,
                or completely accurate.
            </p>

            <p>
                Property information submitted by users may not
                always be independently verified. Users should
                independently evaluate relevant property and
                transaction information before making decisions.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>12. Limitation of Liability</h2>

            <p>
                To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law,
                Vibely and its operators will not be responsible
                for indirect, incidental, special, or consequential
                losses arising from the use of the platform or
                interactions between users.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>13. Account Suspension or Termination</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely may suspend or terminate accounts or
                restrict access to services where we reasonably
                believe that a user has violated these Terms,
                engaged in fraudulent activity, created a security
                risk, or violated applicable law.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>14. Indemnification</h2>

            <p>
                To the extent permitted by applicable law, users
                agree to indemnify and hold Vibely harmless from
                claims, losses, liabilities, damages, and expenses
                arising from their misuse of the platform,
                violation of these Terms, or infringement of
                another person's rights.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>15. Changes to These Terms</h2>

            <p>
                Vibely may update these Terms & Conditions from
                time to time. Updated terms will be posted on this
                page with a revised "Last updated" date.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>16. Governing Law</h2>

            <p>
                These Terms shall be governed by and interpreted
                in accordance with the applicable laws and
                regulations of India, subject to the jurisdiction
                of the appropriate courts.
            </p>

        </section>


        <section class="terms-section">

            <h2>17. Contact</h2>

            <p>
                If you have questions regarding these Terms &
                Conditions, please contact Vibely through the
                contact information provided on the website.
            </p>

        </section>


        <footer class="terms-footer">
            © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Vibely. All rights reserved.
        </footer>

    </main>

</body>

</html>